# =====================================================================
# This repository is PUBLIC.
#
# Per-application material (tailored resumes, cover letters, emails) and
# the profile photo live OUTSIDE this repository, by default in
# ../resume-private/. Keeping them out of the working tree is the real
# safeguard: git cannot commit a file it cannot see.
#
# The entries below are a second line of defence, in case any of those
# folders is ever recreated here by mistake. A pre-commit hook in
# tools/pre-commit is the third. See README.
# =====================================================================
tailored/
output/
assets/
resume-private/
*cover-letter*
*application-message*
*application-letter*
email-*.md

# Version snapshots. Git history already records every past version, so
# dated copies are not published.
archive/
*Resume\ [0-9][0-9][A-Za-z][a-z][a-z][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].pdf
Resume_*.pdf

# =====================================================================
# LaTeX build artifacts
# =====================================================================
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.pdf
*.xdv
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)

# Build directories
build/
dist/

# IDE and editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# =====================================================================
# PUBLIC exceptions: the current general resume and CV only.
# These negations name individual files on purpose. Never broaden them to
# a wildcard such as !output/**/*.pdf, which would expose tailored work.
# =====================================================================
!Mikolaj\ Mieszko\ Charchuta\ Resume.pdf
!variants/Charchuta_Mikolaj_Resume_2page.pdf
!variants/Charchuta_Mikolaj_CV_full.pdf
